paragraph.content:
Subparagraphs (A), (B), and (C) of section 311(d)(2) (relating to appreciated property used to redeem stock)
26 USC 311. are amended to read as follows:
“(A) a distribution to a corporate shareholder if the basis of the property distributed is determined under section 301(d)(2);
“(B) a distribution to which section 302(b)(4) applies and
Ante, p. 478. which is made with respect to qualified stock;
“(C) a distribution of stock or an obligation of a corporation if the requirements of paragraph (2) of subsection (e) are met with respect to the distribution;”.

